  "body": "**[Original report](https://bitbucket.org/agriggio/art/issues/307) by Guy (Bitbucket: [Guy](https://bitbucket.org/Guy), GitHub: [Guy](https://github.com/Guy)).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nFedora silverblue 39 \\(immutable\\), compilation from master branch in a toolbox \\(F39\\) was OK.  \nLaunch ART in the toolbox is fine, but it freezes as soon I choose \\__at first_\\_ a RAW \\(ARW\\). Have to kill the process.  \nWhen I choose editing at first a JPEG, then \\__secondary_\\_ editing the RAW is fine for the full treatment.  \nTried to get a debug version following rawpedia without success\n\n![](https://bitbucket.org/repo/9pArXyE/images/3344615494-Capture%20d%E2%80%99%C3%A9cran%20du%202023-12-09%2010-52-25.png)\n‌\n",
